# Spine golden-rule import-boundary guard (Phase 2).
# One rule per line: <file-glob-being-written> :: <forbidden-substring>
# A write to a file matching the glob is BLOCKED if its new content contains
# the forbidden substring anywhere (conservative: whole-content scan, not a
# real per-language import parser - false positives favor safety here).
# Blank lines and '#' comments ignored. Examples - edit per repo:
# apps/vault/**       :: @pulse/
# apps/pulse/**       :: @vault/
# apps/*/routes/**    :: shared.crossProduct
